  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.1: bug-fix release. Expected user/usage errors in the CLI (bad flags, missing paths, sector-misaligned input, an existing output without --force, overridden format options) are now logged through ILogger.UserError and tagged so BugReportSink never posts them to the Bug Report API; genuine runtime failures are still reported. Adds a DocFX-generated per-member API reference published with the docs site (0 metadata warnings) and moves Pages deployment to a dedicated workflow. Console text and exit codes are unchanged (chdman parity). No public API changes. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
